+---
+id: task-005-cancel-a-booking-with-refund
+type: task
+title: "Cancel a booking with refund"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+# Request
+
+Add `cancel(bookingId, at)` to the rental service: it cancels the booking at time `at` and returns
+`{ bookingId, refund }`, the amount given back to the customer. A cancelled booking no longer holds its
+equipment, and a booking can only be cancelled once.
+
+# Approach
+
+- `at` is an ISO-8601 UTC instant (parsed like other instants); the clock is never read.
+- Refund policy (ASSUMPTION: the request does not state one, to be confirmed by the approver):
+  full `total` when `at` is before the booking's start; no refund (0) once the rental has started.
+  Cancelling at or after the booking's end is rejected: the rental is over.
+- Unknown booking ids and a second cancellation throw. A cancelled booking is removed from the overlap
+  checks, so `book` and `availability` see the equipment as free again.
+- Tests cover refund before/at/after start, after end, double cancel, unknown id, bad `at`, freed equipment.
